menu "Tiercel board"

    config TIERCEL_KNOB_INVERT
        bool "Invert knob direction"
        default n
        help
            Swap clockwise and anticlockwise. The knob's A contact is wired as
            clockwise on the Waveshare 1.8" module; set this only if a unit
            turns the wrong way.

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_LRA
        bool "Drive the haptic motor as an LRA"
        default n
        help
            The schematic labels the motor nets LRA_P/LRA_N, but Waveshare's
            demo drives the DRV2605 in ERM open-loop mode and that works on
            the units tested. Enable this (and set the library to 6, the LRA
            library) if a unit feels weak.

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_LIBRARY
        int "DRV2605 waveform library"
        range 1 7
        default 5
        help
            1-5 are ERM libraries, 6 is LRA, 7 is the 4.5V ERM library. 5 is
            what Waveshare's demo selects.

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_LIMIT_EFFECT
        int "Effect for a knob value at its limit"
        range 1 123
        default 1
        help
            Played on every extra detent once a knob-adjusted value is at its
            minimum or maximum. 1 is "Strong Click 100%" in the DRV2605 ROM
            library table.

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_TAP_EFFECT
        int "Effect for an accepted tap"
        range 1 123
        default 24
        help
            24 is "Sharp Tick 1 100%".

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_CONFIRM_EFFECT
        int "Effect for a committed change"
        range 1 123
        default 10
        help
            10 is "Double Click 100%". Played when something takes effect --
            a device toggles, a mode is set.

    config TIERCEL_HAPTIC_ALERT_EFFECT
        int "Effect for an alarm"
        range 1 123
        default 47
        help
            47 is "Buzz 1 100%".

endmenu
